  "notable_quotes": [
    "Two new Zn(II)-triazole-aliphatic dicarboxylate polymers were hydrothermally synthesized: [Zn(trz)(Hsuc)]n (1) and [Zn2(trz)2(tar)]n (2).",
    "pH is critical: 0.5 mL NaOH is suitable, while no NaOH or higher NaOH doses yield only small amounts or different white powders.",
    "Compound 1 forms a 2D layered network, whereas compound 2 forms a 3D framework with a 3,4-connected topology."
